			<item>
				<title>socket TCP</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/http/socket_tcp/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/http/socket_tcp/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;介绍&#34;&gt;介绍&lt;a href=&#34;#%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;套接字是一种网络API，提供一种进程间的通信方法，使得相同主机或者不同主机上的进程能够使用socket定义的规范进行双向的数据通信。可以实现TCP与UDP方式的通信。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>http 协议</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/http/httpprotocol/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 02 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/http/httpprotocol/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;基本概念&#34;&gt;基本概念&lt;a href=&#34;#%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e6%a6%82%e5%bf%b5&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;简介&#34;&gt;简介&lt;a href=&#34;#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;HTTP协议(超文本传输协议HyperText Transfer Protocol)，它是基于TCP协议的应用层传输协议，简单来说就是客户端和服务端进行数据传输的一种规则。并且http是一种无状态 (stateless) 协议, HTTP协议本身不会对发送过的请求和相应的通信状态进行持久化处理。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>restful 规范</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/http/restful/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 02 Mar 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/http/restful/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;restful&#34;&gt;restful&lt;a href=&#34;#restful&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;简介&#34;&gt;简介&lt;a href=&#34;#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;REST (Representational State Transfe) 只是一种基于HTTP协议的接口设计规范，并不是什么具体的程序库、协议等。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
